From: HDSatelit
Subject: [PATCH] Optional bounded display translations from Enigma2

Base: oe-alliance/ofgwrite 5.0.4, 9ef59e0a50d4ad37db1fbbeeb0c6e11be64f5108.
Display text only. Enigma2 reads the file before init 4 and passes its snapshot
in OFGWRITE_TEXTS. Direct calls load a regular file before the internal UI stop.
Missing or invalid data selects English. Existing flash paths and writes unchanged.

